<li><strong>Our core values</strong> come right below it, as three cards in your order: Convenience, Opportunity and Trust.
<ul dir="ltr">
<li>Convenience: <em>Post a task, compare offers and get it done, all in one place.</em></li>
<li>Opportunity: <em>Every skill finds a need, and every need finds a skill nearby.</em></li>
<li>Trust: <em>Protected contacts, honest reviews and clear records.</em></li>
</ul>
</li>
</ol>
<p dir="ltr">The one-line definitions are optional. If you want only the three words, delete the <code dir="ltr">&lt;p&gt;â€¦&lt;/p&gt;</code> line inside each card. I also spelled it â€œConvenienceâ€ on the site.</p>
<p dir="ltr">Everything else is untouched, including the fresh tasks, search, messaging, terms and notifications. To publish, replace <code dir="ltr">index.html</code> in your GitHub repo with this file, commit, wait a minute, then refresh skynetworks.co.ke.</p></div></div><div data-testid="file-card-stack" class="flex flex-col gap-2 ps-[var(--msg-block-inset,0.5rem)]"><div data-transcript-stays-put=""><div data-cds="Card" data-testid="file-card-block" data-file-row-card="" class="group/card relative isolate flex flex-col rounded-card after:pointer-events-none after:absolute after:inset-0 after:rounded-[inherit] after:shadow-card-ring after:content-[''] has-[[data-cds=CardLink]:focus-visible]:after:shadow-focus stacks:after:transform-none! stacks:[&amp;&gt;.cds-card-fill]:transform-none! stacks:[--cds-card-press-d:0px] stacks:has-[[data-cds=CardLink]:active]:after:bg-neutral-hover stacks:has-[[data-cds=CardLink]]:not-has-[[data-cds=CardLink]:active]:hover:[&amp;&gt;.cds-card-fill:not(.bg-surface-2)]:[--cds-surface-2:var(--cds-fizzy-lake-color-card-hover)] w-full max-w-130" style="--cds-card-press-sx: 0.9914893617021276; --cds-card-press-sy: 0.9375;"><span aria-hidden="true" class="cds-card-fill pointer-events-none absolute inset-0 -z-[1] m-0 rounded-[inherit] text-tint-yellow bg-[color-mix(in_srgb,currentColor_4%,var(--cds-surface-1))] dark:bg-[color-mix(in_srgb,currentColor_8%,var(--cds-surface-1))]"></span><div data-cds-card-body="" class="cds-card-body flex min-h-0 flex-1 flex-col self-stretch [gap:inherit] [align-items:inherit] [justify-content:inherit] rounded-[inherit] p-lg"><div class="flex items-center font-sans"><div class="flex min-w-0 flex-1 items-center gap-sm"><span aria-hidden="true" class="flex size-[calc(2rem*var(--cds-rem-scale,1))] shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-chip text-tint-yellow bg-tint-yellow"><span data-cds="Icon" aria-hidden="true" style="font-size: calc(1.25rem * var(--cds-rem-scale, 1)); font-weight: 433.3;">î‚‚</span></span