<section class="core-values" id="values"><div class="cv-inner"><div class="eyebrow">OUR CORE VALUES</div><div class="cv-grid"><article><b>Convenience</b><p>Post a task, compare offers and get it done, all in one place.</p></article><article><b>Opportunity</b><p>Every skill finds a need, and every need finds a skill nearby.</p></article><article><b>Trust</b><p>Protected contacts, honest reviews and clear records.</p></article></div></div></section>
